      "post_subject": "cyrstal clear gelatin film?",
      "content_md": "I haven't used Knox gelatin, so I don't know how brown it is.\n\nI believe that Knox is quite popular amongst home holographers in the USA.\n\nAll of the gelatins I have, have some colouration of sorts when viewed in the packet,\n\nor when dissolved in water, but as we are just using thin coatings of tens of microns at most, you don't\n\nsee the colour of the gelatin when the glass has been coated.\n\nI don't worry about it.\n\nSteven.",
